<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Bangalore to Tirupati | Call 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does Bike Transport From Bangalore To Tirupati typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit normally spans 1‑2 days, depending on traffic and weather. Our dedicated hydraulic ramp trailers travel the 850 km highway corridor nonstop, ensuring your bike reaches Tirupati within the promised window while maintaining zero‑scratch protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included for my bike during the Bangalore‑to‑Tirupati move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering loss, theft, and accidental damage. The policy is activated from pickup in Bangalore until final doorstep delivery in Tirupati, with a simple claim process handled by our support team.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Bangalore to Tirupati?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live updates to our portal and mobile app. You receive instant alerts for each major checkpoint, so you can monitor the exact location of your bike throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents do I need to provide for bike transport between Bangalore and Tirupati?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Required documents include a valid bike registration certificate, a government‑issued ID, GST‑compliant invoice, and an e‑Way bill for interstate movement. Our team assists in preparing and filing these papers to ensure smooth, hassle‑free transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a difference between standard bike shipping and the hydraulic ramp service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp service uses specialized enclosed carriers with a hydraulic loading ramp, eliminating manual lifting and preventing scratches. Standard bike shipping may involve open loading, which carries higher risk of surface damage during loading and unloading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the cost of Bike Transport From Bangalore To Tirupati compare with other movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our transparent pricing separates mileage, fuel surcharge, insurance, and handling fees, offering a clear quote without hidden charges. Compared to generic packers, our specialized service often provides better value due to reduced damage risk and faster delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you handle bike transport for corporate relocations or only individual owners?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We cater to both individual bike owners and corporate clients. Our fleet can accommodate multiple bikes in a single shipment, and we provide consolidated invoicing, GST compliance, and corporate insurance options for seamless office relocations.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
